Revision history for Game-Oware

0.02    2026-10-07
	- Pick a move with the arrow keys in the terminal, previewing the
	  position the move would produce.
	- The terminal board is drawn as a board: a store at each end, seed
	  clusters, colour, and a mark on every house the last move touched.
	- Fix: --ascii was a second glyph table identical to the first.
	- Fix: --quiet swallowed the result.
	- Fix: a command answered on the prompt's own line off a terminal.

